<title>UK: LIFFE coffee ends at 18 month high, cocoa in range.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee ends at 18 month high, cocoa in range.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Jumps on NY surge. July ends $158 higher at $2,260, highest on second month since Nov 1995</p>
<p>COCOA - Ends mixed in tight range. July two stg higher at 1,021 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Rangebound, mixed with volume inflated by spreads. August up 30 cents at $320.50 at 1610 GMT.</p>
</text>
